  "section": "3.185",
  "rulesText": "This section presents the Paladin spell list. The spells are organized by spell level and then alphabetized, and each spell's school of magic is listed. In the Special column, C means the spell requires Concentration, R means it's a Ritual, and M means it requires a specific Material component.\n\nLevel I Paladin Spells\n\nLevel 2 Paladin Spells\n\nLevel 3 Paladin Spells\n\nLevel 4 Paladin Spells\n\nLevel 5 Paladin Spells",
